DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
15977::$$$message_0124_0000_0000$$$::[font italic=true]Oh.[font italic=false][lr]::
15978::$$$message_0124_0000_0001$$$::I spot a delinquent Heroic Spirit squatting in front of the church.::
15979::$$$message_0124_0001_0000$$$::"What are you doing, Lancer? Are you sunbathing?"[lr]::
15980::$$$message_0124_0001_0001$$$::"I don't have that kind of hobby.[lr]::
15981::$$$message_0124_0001_0002$$$::I got kicked out so I watered the flowers, watered the road, and ran out of things to do, so I was zoning out."::
15982::$$$message_0124_0002_0000$$$::...That's what society calls sunbathing...[lr]::
15983::$$$message_0124_0002_0001$$$::His way of sunbathing might be on the level of being cooked on the beach like an iron griddle. He's tan enough to beat Archer.[lr]::
15984::$$$message_0124_0002_0002$$$::Anyway.::
15985::$$$message_0124_0003_0000$$$::"Why did you get kicked out? Is someone inside?"[lr]::
15986::$$$message_0124_0003_0001$$$::"Yeah, someone came. Some visitor or Kotomine's successor. They were dressed unfashionably like a priest, so there's no doubt that they're someone from the church."::
15987::$$$message_0124_0004_0000$$$::"...Someone from the church. Did they kick you out?"[lr]::
15988::$$$message_0124_0004_0001$$$::"Yeah. They said they're investigating something, so they asked me to leave... They were the type of person I'm not good with. Well, I'm sure they'll leave right away if I leave them alone, so I'm killing time like this."::
15989::$$$message_0124_0005_0000$$$::Lancer grumbles in dissatisfaction.[lr]::
15990::$$$message_0124_0005_0001$$$::...But, it's unexpected.[lr]::
15991::$$$message_0124_0005_0002$$$::To think that there's someone that this man isn't good with, despite talking to Saber or Rider familiarly.::
15992::$$$message_0124_0006_0000$$$::"Lancer. Do you think I can go inside?"[lr]::
15993::$$$message_0124_0006_0001$$$::"Probably. It's not like I was told to keep guard."[lr]::
15994::$$$message_0124_0006_0002$$$::Lancer is apathetic.[lr]::
15995::$$$message_0124_0006_0003$$$::He must've gotten tired of sunbathing. I wave to Lancer, who starts to water with the watering can in one hand, and open the door of the church.::
15996::$$$message_0124_0007_0000$$$::There's no one in the chapel.[lr]::
15997::$$$message_0124_0007_0001$$$::The priest that welcomed me here half a year ago is still missing since that battle.[lr]::
15998::$$$message_0124_0007_0002$$$::"What? No one's here."[lr]::
15999::$$$message_0124_0007_0003$$$::I look around the courtyard, the stairs leading to the basement, the stairs leading to the second floor, and Kotomine's room, but the church is completely empty.::
16000::$$$message_0124_0008_0000$$$::"Lancer, no one's here. Maybe they left through the back[line len=2]"[lr]::
16001::$$$message_0124_0008_0001$$$::...Lancer is also gone.[lr]::
16002::$$$message_0124_0008_0002$$$::He must've noticed the futility of devoting oneself to watering and gone back to the park in front of the station.[lr]::
16003::$$$message_0124_0008_0003$$$::The watering can has been left in the square.[lr]::
16004::$$$message_0124_0008_0004$$$::This is also experience.[lr]::
16005::$$$message_0124_0008_0005$$$::I water the flowers with the water left in the watering can and also leave the church.::

